{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0264_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6def5cfdab7c0ffd8b2953a79b0e3c8f5427a77f0914205802f061ec5994d266", "ja": "朋花、お疲れさま。\n新しい衣装、なにか感想があれば教えてくれ。", "zh": "朋花，辛苦了。\n新衣服有什么感想的话，告诉我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0264_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "ed48fc3525315bda75e1f0e9a25795732c87052abe03b66d068b6cb6ee740889", "ja": "可愛らしくて、素敵だと思いますよ～♪\nこれは、甘ロリ……というものですよね～。", "zh": "我觉得很可爱、很棒哦～♪\n这就是所谓的……甜美洛丽塔吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0264_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "dfa8006e652b227a0134b37425ef3b25a5127c8dc60945ab0b825c1868c178e7", "ja": "ただ、少しだけ気になることがあるのですが……。\n聞いてもいいですか、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "不过，有件事让我有点在意……\n可以问问吗，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0264_1003_p", "source_sha256": "5dbfcca438e8abbeaaeff049a16f291d2d6fdb07880487a224949be30194205a", "ja": "もちろん。なんだろう？", "zh": "当然可以。是什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0264_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "4df80a345c54e16ce60f61134f7041401ea4b3066a5179cd07d82a285aaebbb2", "ja": "この衣装、幼く見えてしまいませんか～？　ロリータ\nファッションとはそういうものかもしれませんが……。", "zh": "这身服装，会不会显得有些年幼呢～？洛丽塔时尚或许就是这样的风格……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0264_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "1822005777f4d2c9de54bf1ed4cef0782af30fbd3f3dd19b6aa725a19851ed1a", "ja": "聖母の癒しを求めている子豚ちゃんたちが、\n幼い印象の私を見たら、どう思うでしょうか～？", "zh": "那些寻求圣母治愈的小猪们，要是看到看起来很年幼的我，会怎么想呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0264_1006_p", "source_sha256": "bc133b901c8f06fb27e245b89c75b108b89224407351ca8b9b6b23baf7fbe691", "ja": "うーん？　それは大丈夫だと思うけど。\n髪型のおかげかな？　むしろ大人びて見える気がする。", "zh": "嗯？我觉得没关系吧。  \n是发型的功劳吗？反而感觉看起来更成熟了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0264_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "da996dcb636ba4947a3cf93d6a711d2189d16b3e328156c374e28d9fa1f8ad5d", "ja": "これは……そうですね～。衣装に合うように、色々と\n試してみました～。大人びた雰囲気も出せれば、と。", "zh": "这个嘛……是的～为了和服装搭配，我试了各种各样的发型～。想着要是也能展现出成熟的感觉就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0264_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "745021fde38a15b2070fc27a43c32842bc8c792166e06774f90b3c4892093668", "ja": "前々から、違う髪形も見てみたいという、\n子豚ちゃんたちの希望もありましたから～。", "zh": "因为小猪们从很久以前就希望能看看不一样的发型了嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0264_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e0e07e9661420438dd5891483a42d0cf5b603a3bae220849680171e05124ead4", "ja": "うん、それなら狙い通りだと思うよ。\n大人っぽさと幼さを、両立できてるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "嗯，那样的话我觉得正合心意哦。\n成熟与青涩兼备，效果很不错吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0264_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "1e4662ac84628bd31e3a57c236c29904bd4579966dfa69f624d2be54bd807483", "ja": "ふむ～……まあ、いいでしょう～。\n納得できる意見ですね～、褒めてあげますよ～。", "zh": "嗯～……好吧，也可以接受～。\n这是个令人信服的意见呢～我就夸奖你一下吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0264_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "e35cd15cff134aff585caac9d295213a3c63eb23e786381ec048589906b7b910", "ja": "でも……本来であれば{$P$}さんが、\nどういう髪型がいいか、指示するべきでは～？", "zh": "但是……按理来说，应该由{$P$}先生来指示什么发型比较合适吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0264_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "8f311d33ece1a5346b2f227c340e27e7186b3f29322c1f5986888e14dc58615c", "ja": "素晴らしい衣装が用意できたからといって、\nそこで気を抜いてはいけませんよ～？", "zh": "不能因为准备好了很棒的服装，就在这时候松懈下来哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0264_1013_p", "source_sha256": "32a92a82c837403b3fa06b5ae5c008b769b01a292d9ff1506b8232e9bd7d51d3", "ja": "あ、ああ、ゴメン……いや、気は抜いてないけど！\nそもそも狙ってたのは、幼さのある朋花だったんだよ。", "zh": "啊、啊，抱歉……不，我可没有松懈！\n说到底，我原本瞄准的就是带有稚气的朋花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0264_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "74533ca42ee8bd01458117576f2f00a5b2340e2c3bea508de667ecc9b1a75b85", "ja": "……。ふふっ。\nどういうつもりか、詳しく聞かせてくれますか～？", "zh": "……呵呵。\n可以详细说说，你到底是怎么想的吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0264_1015_p", "source_sha256": "65ae0a1323229bdc1cb49e8ce9ebee7086d852aaf303920f75635f045aaad2d5", "ja": "うん。朋花はやっぱり、大人びてるから。\nあ、もちろんそれは、朋花の魅力のひとつだけど……。", "zh": "嗯。朋花果然还是很成熟。\n啊，当然，这也是朋花的魅力之一……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0264_1016_p", "source_sha256": "30a6eead82b7d93ec83937cd3e56d1cce647ebe04d54f61967b56becde6a4f9c", "ja": "ちょっと、隙がなさすぎるっていうかな……。\nだから、たまにはそういう衣装もいいと思ったんだ。", "zh": "该怎么说呢，你有点太无懈可击了……  \n所以我觉得，偶尔穿穿那种风格的服装也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0264_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "d5df93ba4037531774a94bdb18d06ee0ef5e81c8322bc6420db374a9160a3dac", "ja": "……うふふ♪　そんな事だろうと思いましたよ～。\n私の印象を決めようなんて、傲慢ですね～。", "zh": "……呵呵♪ 我就猜到会是这样～  \n想要决定我给人的印象，还真是傲慢呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0264_1018_p", "source_sha256": "930deaea6328496ae6878aac422039d8d7e9d3518dda67ccdcccf4cdb945a92d", "ja": "そうだな、ちょっと傲慢だったかもしれない。\n朋花のおかげで、狙い以上のものになったと思うよ。", "zh": "是啊，可能确实有点傲慢了。多亏了朋花，我觉得最后的效果超出了预期。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0264_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "af86cbf944402fe082e279154a35ffbf00492eeaee61629a674963b5be9269bb", "ja": "ふふ、でも……可愛い聖母を見てみたい、という、\n熱心な気持ちは、伝わりました～。", "zh": "呵呵，不过……想看看可爱圣母的那份热切心情，我已经感受到了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0264_1020_031tom", "source_sha256": "d4ff1dc27e3f1f387ab5382597a2f39e976ccd1cd9c997faa2f0ae8080cccb24", "ja": "素敵な衣装のご褒美に……。\nたまになら、甘い私も、見せてあげましょうか～♪", "zh": "作为漂亮服装的奖励……偶尔的话，也让你看看甜甜的我吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0264_1021_p", "source_sha256": "a9ec60b961cf589dc40198b74b44a4c7e7f90776297e557ff9ee4c80031377b9", "ja": "うん、ありがとう。でもせっかくだから、子豚ちゃ……\nいや、ファンのみんなに見せてあげてくれ！", "zh": "嗯，谢谢。不过难得有这样的机会，就给小猪们……不，给所有粉丝们看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0264_1022_031tom", "source_sha256": "f17c9b2c524c242ca37db0e7b7aefcbd1ad85aec822aabd3cb859a3cb0b70ac0", "ja": "……。見くびらないでください～。\nそんな事は、もちろんわかっていますよ～。", "zh": "……别小看我了哦～\n这种事，我当然明白啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0264_1023_031tom", "source_sha256": "0a85d76acc4037d4fc3360024adec1868a5a8d93b2e8041244f6a7b2fef2aa83", "ja": "欲張りなあなたと、子豚ちゃん達のために……。\n聖母の光を、あまねく届けましょう～♪", "zh": "为了贪心的你和小猪们……  \n让圣母的光芒普照四方吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
